===Other fires===
<!--For fires smaller than 1,000 acres that didn't cause much damage but resulted in injuries-->
Three people were injured during the Moose Fire (August&nbsp;12–17).<ref>{{cite web|publisher=California Department of Forestry and Fire Protection|date=August 18, 2019|access-date=October 30, 2019|title=Moose Fire|url=https://www.fire.ca.gov/incidents/2019/8/12/moose-fire/}}</ref> Two people were injured and four structures were destroyed during the Country Fire (September&nbsp;3–6).<ref>{{cite web|publisher=California Department of Forestry and Fire Protection|date=September 6, 2019|access-date=October 30, 2019|title=Country Fire|url=https://www.fire.ca.gov/incidents/2019/9/3/country-fire/}}</ref> Four people were injured during the Lopez Fire (September&nbsp;21–27),<ref>{{cite web|publisher=Los Angeles Fire Department|date=September 30, 2019|access-date=October 21, 2019|title=Lopez Fire|url=https://www.fire.ca.gov/incidents/2019/9/21/lopez-fire/}}</ref> and one during the Electra Fire (September&nbsp;25).<ref>{{cite web|publisher=Los Angeles Fire Department|date=September 25, 2019|access-date=October 21, 2019|title=Electra Fire|url=https://www.fire.ca.gov/incidents/2019/9/25/electra-fire/}}</ref> A small brush fire ignited in [[Pacific Palisades, Los Angeles|Pacific Palisades]] in Los Angeles County on October&nbsp;21. The fire burned {{convert|42|acres|hectare|abbr=on}} within a few hours, forcing the evacuation of 200&nbsp;homes.<ref name="LAFD_PPal">{{cite web|publisher=Los Angeles Fire Department|date=October 25, 2019|access-date=October 29, 2019|title=Palisades Brush Fire|url=https://www.lafd.org/news/pacific-palisades-brush-fire}}</ref> Three firefighters suffered injuries, while one civilian was treated for respiratory illness.<ref name="LAFD_PPal"/><ref name="PPal">{{cite news|author=Hannah Fry, Alejandra Reyes-Belarde, Colleen Shalby, Sonja Sharp, and Leila Miller|newspaper=Los Angeles Times|date=October 21, 2019|access-date=October 29, 2019|title=Evacuations are lifted after brush fire burns near Pacific Palisades homes|url=https://www.latimes.com/california/story/2019-10-21/brush-fire-in-pacific-palisades-threatens-homes}}</ref>

